Slight gripe about the new nh3.1 interface, and the fix for it.

You'll notice that in tty mode, if you just hit <ret> in answer to a
"what type of...do you want to pickup/remove/etc?", you'll be prompted
with all the items. But in the X11 mode, if you just hit <ret>, it
bails out of the dialog, without prompts. 

The fix is to change line 995 from:

Strcpy(getline_input, CANCEL_STR);

to:

Strcpy(getline_input, " ");



